      "content": "That is a valid concern from the analytics team regarding missed in-the-moment nuance. Perhaps we could explore processing shorter, buffered chunks of audio data periodically, rather than the full live feed? This might provide near real-time alerts without the constant stream that seems to distract the diplomats. I can collaborate with the tech team to see if a hybrid, less intrusive solution is feasible.",
